  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for refugees with disabilities and special needs, and their families from Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Mudita will concretely cover shelter related costs: &#x2022; 31 000 PLN ( ~6490 EUR) for the deposit for the new to rent &#x2022; 16.000 PLN (~3350 EUR) adaptation / renovation &#x2022; 15 500 PLN (~3245 EUR) first month of rent. -Opening a reception point adapted to host people with disabilities and their families in Krakow where 6 people alternate shift duty at this reception point.-offering Polish language classes to people-offer individual and group psychological and mental health consultations. -Provide first necessity items-access full board meals to the residents, possibly adjusting meals to special nutritional needs,-provide awareness sessions and information that facilitates the integration of residents in the Polish healthcare and legal system-provide solutions and alternative long term shelter or housing for each family after a duration of maximum 30-day at the center. Ensuring that basic needs of the residents are met throughout.</narrative>
  </description>
